# The ATM in the temple and the receptionist at the Grunting Boar: the `bank`
# and `receptionist` specials, and the four commands between them.
#
# No `rent`, deliberately: renting takes the character out of the world and
# saves afterwards, off the world goroutine here, and the next scenario in
# the table logs the same character straight back in.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
goto 3001
look at atm
balance
deposit 100
balance
withdraw 50
balance
deposit all
balance
withdraw 100000
deposit nothing
withdraw nothing
goto 3008
look
offer
quit
